## Commands Quick Reference

Bun is the local/VPS runtime (`>=1.4.2`), with `bun:sqlite`; pnpm is the dependency
manager (`pnpm@11`). Production and staging Workers use vinext/Vite and SQLite
Durable Object storage. Docker remains a local and recovery path.

- Install deps: `pnpm install` (run `corepack enable` first) — never `bun install` or `npm install`
- Dev servers: `bun run dev` → Next.js on `http://localhost:3000` + Bun API on `:3201`
- Build: `bun run build` (Next build + `assert-standalone-clean` gate)
- Worker: `bun run dev:vinext`, `bun run build:cloudflare` (staging),
  `bun run build:cloudflare:production`, `bun run test:cloudflare`. Use the cf-cli
  skill for authorized Cloudflare operations; deploy is never implied by a build.
  Domain attachment additionally requires `CLOUDFLARE_BIND_CUSTOM_DOMAINS=1` at
  build time and accepted data/rollback gates; see `docs/DEPLOY.md` before applying triggers.
- Lint: `bun run lint` (`--max-warnings=0`). Autofix: `bun run lint:fix`
- Types: `bun run typecheck`
- Format: `bun run format`
- Tests: `bun run test -- --run --coverage` (Vitest once, with the coverage gate). Single file:
  `bun x vitest tests/lib/bet-generator.test.ts --run`
- UI: Argent Chromium; `bun run test:argent` (saved generator regression; see README)
- DB: `bun run db:migrate`, then `bun run db:pull` to ingest draws from the CAIXA API;
  `bun run db:export-draws` refreshes the public seed and `bun run db:import-draws <seed>`
  appends missing draws to a live DB (see `docs/DEPLOY.md`)
- IndexNow: `bun run seo:indexnow -- --contests N` (needs `INDEXNOW_KEY`)

Security & config:

- Copy `.env.example` to `.env.local`. `IP_HASH_SECRET` (≥32 chars) is required in
  production — the server exits without it.
- Secret scans: `bun run security:secrets`, `bun run security:secrets:history`.
- There is no Supabase here. SQLite is a local file on Bun and private Durable
  Object storage on the production/staging Worker path.

Full contract: `AGENTS.md` at the repo root.
